{"seq":3,"slug":"stockout-overstock-exception","title":"缺货、滞销与库存健康异常治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/overseas-warehouse-network-placement/inventory-deployment-allocation/stockout-overstock-exception","wordCount":2882,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"缺货-滞销与库存健康异常治理\">缺货、滞销与库存健康异常治理</h1><p>同一批货在海外仓里只有两种坏结局：<strong>该有的地方没有</strong>（缺货，错过销售并让 Listing 权重下滑），和<strong>不该压的地方压着</strong>（滞销，吃仓储费与库龄附加费，最后被迫清仓甚至弃置）。二者并不独立——堆高安全库存能压缺货，却直接生成滞销；为清滞销而砍备货，又会在旺季制造断货。库存健康治理的本质，是<strong>在一个双向成本的系统里持续把异常拉回中枢</strong>。水位怎么算见 <a href=\"multi-echelon-inventory-model\">多级库存部署模型与安全库存水位设定</a>，铺货量怎么切见 <a href=\"allocation-placement-algorithm\">分仓铺货与首铺/补货分配算法</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-库存健康四象限与异常分类\">核心概念：库存健康四象限与异常分类</h2><p>库存健康不是「好/坏」的单一判断，而是<strong>按动销速度与库存深度两轴切出的四象限</strong>，每个 SKU-in-仓落到象限里，异常治理才有对象：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>象限</th>\n<th>动销（销量趋势）</th>\n<th>库存深度（可售天数）</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>首要动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>高/上升</td>\n<td>低（&lt; 安全水位）</td>\n<td><strong>缺货风险</strong></td>\n<td>加速补货 / 跨仓调拨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>II</td>\n<td>高/上升</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td><strong>健康热销</strong></td>\n<td>维持，监控提前期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>III</td>\n<td>低/下滑</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td><strong>濒危/待淘汰</strong></td>\n<td>决策续销或停售</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IV</td>\n<td>低/下滑</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td><strong>滞销/呆滞</strong></td>\n<td>分层清仓 / 移除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表纠正一个常见错误：<strong>只看绝对库存量判断滞销</strong>。同样 500 件，在日销 50 件的 SKU 上是 10 天库存（偏紧），在日销 3 件的 SKU 上是 167 天库存（重度呆滞）。所有异常判定都必须用<strong>相对指标</strong>（可售天数、售罄率）。按处置路径再细分：**缺货（stockout）**是需求存在而可售库存为零导致的销售损失，<strong>平台侧缺货</strong>还包括「有货但 Listing 被抑制（suppressed）或不可售」；**滞销（slow-moving）**是动销显著低于同类基线；**呆滞（dead stock）**指超过库龄阈值（常见 180/270/365 天）仍未售出；**搁浅库存（stranded inventory）**是亚马逊特有口径——存放在 FBA 却没有有效在售 Listing 的货。</p>\n<h2 id=\"库存健康指标体系与异常识别阈值\">库存健康指标体系与异常识别阈值</h2><p>治理的前提是可度量。跨境网络需要一套<strong>同时覆盖供给与需求两侧</strong>的指标，每个都有明确口径与阈值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>口径 / 公式</th>\n<th>健康区间（经验值）</th>\n<th>异常信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>在库率 In-Stock Rate</td>\n<td>有可售库存的 SKU-天 / 总 SKU-天</td>\n<td>≥ 95%（A 类 ≥ 98%）</td>\n<td>跌破 90% 触发缺货专项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可售天数 Days of Supply (DOH)</td>\n<td>期末可售库存 / 近 30 日日均销量</td>\n<td>30–60 天（海运链路）</td>\n<td>&lt; 28 天低库存预警；&gt; 120 天滞销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>售罄率 Sell-Through Rate</td>\n<td>某期销量 /（期初库存 + 期间入库）</td>\n<td>按品类基线 ±20%</td>\n<td>显著低于基线 → 滞销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存周转率</td>\n<td>销货成本 / 平均库存成本（年化）</td>\n<td>越高越省资金，过高=安全库存不足</td>\n<td>同类后 25% 分位 → 审查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超龄/搁浅占比</td>\n<td>超阈值库龄或无在售 Listing 库存 / 总库存</td>\n<td>超龄 &lt; 10%、搁浅趋近 0</td>\n<td>上升即资金占用恶化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>口径陷阱有三处。<strong>在库率的粒度决定它能发现什么</strong>：按 SKU 汇总会掩盖「A 类爆款断货、C 类长尾满仓」的结构性失衡，必须下钻到 SKU-仓。<strong>可售天数必须扣掉在途与不可售（客诉、待检、被预留）库存</strong>。<strong>周转率是结果指标而非诊断指标</strong>。亚马逊的库存绩效指标（Inventory Performance Index, IPI）把其中几项打包成 0–1000 的综合分（<strong>超龄库存占比、售罄率、搁浅库存占比、在库率</strong>），并决定卖家能拿到的仓储容量上限（Amazon, <a href=\"https://sell.amazon.com）。它的启示是**把互相制衡的指标合成单一目标**：只优化在库率会被超龄库存反噬，只清超龄库存又会让在库率掉。\">https://sell.amazon.com）。它的启示是**把互相制衡的指标合成单一目标**：只优化在库率会被超龄库存反噬，只清超龄库存又会让在库率掉。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"缺货治理-归因-止损与补货加速\">缺货治理：归因、止损与补货加速</h2><p>缺货的第一动作不是补货，而是<strong>归因</strong>——不同根因的处置成本差一个数量级，补错方向会同时制造滞销：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[检测到 SKU-仓 可售天数为 0] --&gt; B{仓库实际有货吗}&#10;    B --&gt;|有货但不可售| C[平台侧问题&lt;br/&gt;Listing 被抑制/合规]&#10;    B --&gt;|无货| D{整网缺货还是单仓缺货}&#10;    D --&gt;|单仓缺| E[跨仓调拨]&#10;    D --&gt;|整网缺| F{需求超预期还是供给延迟}&#10;    F --&gt;|需求超预期| G[上调预测&lt;br/&gt;紧急空运/快递补货]&#10;    F --&gt;|供给延迟| H[头程/清关/派送追踪&lt;br/&gt;重排到货计划]&#10;    C --&gt; I[修复 Listing 后重新上架]&#10;    E --&gt; J[按边际缺货成本分配有限库存]&#10;    G --&gt; J&#10;    H --&gt; K[对买家侧做预售/延长交期]\">graph TD\n    A[检测到 SKU-仓 可售天数为 0] --&gt; B{仓库实际有货吗}\n    B --&gt;|有货但不可售| C[平台侧问题&lt;br/&gt;Listing 被抑制/合规]\n    B --&gt;|无货| D{整网缺货还是单仓缺货}\n    D --&gt;|单仓缺| E[跨仓调拨]\n    D --&gt;|整网缺| F{需求超预期还是供给延迟}\n    F --&gt;|需求超预期| G[上调预测&lt;br/&gt;紧急空运/快递补货]\n    F --&gt;|供给延迟| H[头程/清关/派送追踪&lt;br/&gt;重排到货计划]\n    C --&gt; I[修复 Listing 后重新上架]\n    E --&gt; J[按边际缺货成本分配有限库存]\n    G --&gt; J\n    H --&gt; K[对买家侧做预售/延长交期]</pre><p><strong>归因的价值在于成本</strong>：单仓缺货用跨仓调拨解决，成本是干线运费与时效；整网缺货只能靠紧急空运，成本比海运高 3–8 倍。若把整网缺货误判为单仓缺货，会导致「从另一个也缺货的仓调货」，制造第二个缺货点。止损分三条腿：<strong>买家侧</strong>开放预售或延长承诺交期；<strong>供给侧</strong>把在途未清关部分改走更快通道；<strong>决策侧</strong>把有限库存优先给<strong>边际缺货成本最高</strong>的 SKU-仓：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mtext>lost</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>no-sub</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{lost},i} = D_i \\cdot GM_i \\cdot P_{\\text{no-sub}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lost</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">no-sub</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为缺货期日均需求，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">GM_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为单位毛利，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>no-sub</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{no-sub}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">no-sub</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为「缺货且无替代品时的流失概率」。缺货还有<strong>非线性的隐性成本</strong>：平台会因缺货降低 Listing 排名权重，且权重恢复滞后于补货到货数周，需对缺货天数额外加排名惩罚系数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滞销与呆滞治理-分层处置阶梯与清仓决策\">滞销与呆滞治理：分层处置阶梯与清仓决策</h2><p>滞销治理的核心不是「打折清货」，而是<strong>按库存深度与剩余处置空间走一条成本递增的阶梯</strong>：<strong>跨仓再平衡</strong>（调拨，货没贬值只付运费）→ <strong>价格与促销</strong>（降价、优惠券、捆绑、秒杀）→ <strong>站外与渠道清货</strong>（分销给折扣渠道、员工内购、批发商，单价被压但一次清量大）→ <strong>平台清仓工具</strong>（亚马逊 Outlet 与 Liquidation 等）→ <strong>移除或弃置</strong>（付费移仓或当地销毁，需额外付移除费，通常是最后手段）。\n何时进入下一级，关键是<strong>把「继续持有」与「立即清仓」做一次净现值比较</strong>。持有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 天的边际成本含仓储费、库龄附加费、资金成本与贬值，立即清仓损失的是「目标售价 − 清货回收价」。设年资金成本率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>仓储</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>库龄附加费</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mn>365</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>资金</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>贬值</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(t) = \\underbrace{s \\cdot t}_{\\text{仓储}} + \\underbrace{A(t)}_{\\text{库龄附加费}} + \\underbrace{r \\cdot C \\cdot \\frac{t}{365}}_{\\text{资金}} + \\underbrace{\\Delta V(t)}_{\\text{贬值}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9414em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">仓储</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span cla