=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">贬值</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 超过「持有期望售价 − 立即清货价」时清仓即理性。库龄附加费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 常是最后一根稻草——它与阈值挂钩且<strong>非线性跳档</strong>，使某些时点清货明显优于继续压仓。处置阶梯还必须与<strong>根因修复</strong>并行：滞销根因有三类——<strong>预测过高</strong>（首铺量偏大，需回灌修正预测模型）、<strong>产品/Listing 问题</strong>（点击与转化显著低于同类）、<strong>季节或生命周期尾期</strong>（本就该退出，重点是回收残值）。给每个滞销 SKU 打根因码能反向监控预测质量：若「预测过高」占比长期偏高，要修的是预测算法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平台规则驱动的库龄与低库存成本\">平台规则驱动的库龄与低库存成本</h2><p>2026 年的关键变化是：<strong>平台把库存健康直接货币化</strong>，用附加费惩罚两端异常，使治理从「内部成本优化」变成「显性现金流成本」。**库龄附加费（aged inventory surcharge）**对超过 181 天的库存按月计费且随库龄跳档。<strong>2026 年费率表</strong>（Amazon Seller Central，转引自 SellerApp，<a href=\"https://www.sellerapp.com/blog/amazon-fba-fees/）给出的美国站费率约为：\">https://www.sellerapp.com/blog/amazon-fba-fees/）给出的美国站费率约为：</a></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>库龄段</th>\n<th>每立方英尺</th>\n<th>或每件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>181–270 天</td>\n<td>$0.50</td>\n<td>$0.15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>271–365 天</td>\n<td>$0.69</td>\n<td>$0.30</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>365 天以上</td>\n<td>$0.79</td>\n<td>$0.35</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>计费取「每立方英尺」与「每件」两者中<strong>较高</strong>者——大件商品在体积维度被重罚，仓储成本会快速吞掉毛利。这个跳档结构正是上一节 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 非线性项的来源：货一旦跨过 271 天，月成本近似翻倍，清仓阈值随之提前。</p>\n<p><strong>低库存水平费（low-inventory-level fee）<strong>惩罚另一端：当某商品的</strong>长期（近 90 天）与短期（近 30 天）可售天数同时低于 28 天</strong>时，对每笔发货订单加收该费（Amazon Seller Central，转引自 Jungle Scout，<a href=\"https://www.junglescout.com/resources/articles/amazon-fba-fees/）。2026\">https://www.junglescout.com/resources/articles/amazon-fba-fees/）。2026</a> 年该费已细化到 FNSKU 粒度并按尺寸分段，小号标准件最低约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.32</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>件，大号标准件约</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.32/件，大号标准件约</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.32/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">件，大号标准件约</span></span></span></span></span>0.63–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.51</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>件，大件从约</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.51/件，大件从约</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.51/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">件，大件从约</span></span></span></span></span>1.68/件起。两个规则合起来构成一个<strong>双向约束带</strong>：可售天数 &lt; 28 天被收低库存费，库龄 &gt; 181 天被收库龄费，健康区间被平台压到大约 <strong>28–180 天</strong>之间。<strong>门槛值应作为阈值表的配置输入而非常数写死</strong>：不同站点、尺寸段、年份的费率都会变（见 <a href=\"../node-siting-selection/siting-factors-landed-cost-model\">选址因子与总落地成本模型</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"例外管理闭环-分级预警-根因码与自动化\">例外管理闭环：分级预警、根因码与自动化</h2><p>健康的库存不是「没有异常」——长尾 SKU 里异常永远存在——而是<strong>异常被发现、分级并被处置的速率</strong>。这要求一套**例外管理（management by exception）**机制，按严重度分层：<strong>P0</strong>（当日，A 类 SKU 整网可售天数 &lt; 7 天）、<strong>P1</strong>（本周，B 类越界、库龄 150–180 天临近跳档）、<strong>P2</strong>（本月，C 类滞销、搁浅库存清理）、<strong>P3</strong>（观察，阈值边缘波动）。</p>\n<p>层级化阈值的前提是<strong>按 SKU 分层而非全局统一</strong>——A/B/C 分层（按销售额占比）与 XYZ 分层（按需求波动）决定谁值得精算、谁只需批量处置。<strong>根因码（reason code）<strong>是闭环的记忆：每次处置记录一个根因（预测过高、供给延迟、Listing 抑制、季节性、政策变动等）与一个动作，积累后可回答</strong>哪类根因损失最大</strong>与<strong>哪类动作有效率高</strong>。闭环为：日度采集库存/动销/在途/库龄 → 计算健康指标 → 按 ABC-XYZ 分层做阈值分类 → 生成建议 → 无争议动作自动执行并记根因码、高成本动作转人工 → 结果回灌预测与铺货模型。</p>\n<p>闭环最后一步「回灌」最容易被跳过，却是治理能否收敛的关键：<strong>每周的缺货与滞销结果必须回流到需求预测和首铺算法</strong>，否则同一类预测偏差会重复制造异常。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>库存健康是<strong>双向成本系统</strong>：压缺货会生成滞销，清滞销会诱发缺货，目标是持续把异常拉回中枢。</li>\n<li>异常必须<strong>按相对指标（可售天数、售罄率）在 SKU-仓粒度</strong>判定，四象限把缺货风险、健康热销、濒危、滞销区分开；只看绝对存量会系统性误判。- 缺货治理先<strong>归因再补货</strong>：单仓缺货靠调拨、整网缺货才需空运；有限库存按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mtext>lost</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{lost},i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lost</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降序分配；缺货还有排名权重下滑的隐性非线性成本。</li>\n<li>滞销治理走<strong>成本递增的五级阶梯</strong>（再平衡 → 促销 → 渠道清货 → 平台清仓 → 移除/弃置），判据是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与立即清货损失的比较，库龄附加费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的非线性跳档常是决定因素。</li>\n<li><strong>2026 年平台规则把库存健康货币化</strong>：库龄附加费（181 天起，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.50</mn><mo>→</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.50→</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span></span></span></span></span>0.79/立方英尺按月跳档）与低库存水平费（90 天与 30 天可售天数同时 &lt; 28 天触发）把健康区间压到约 28–180 天。</li>\n<li><strong>例外管理闭环</strong> = 分层预警（按 ABC-XYZ 设 P0–P3）+ 根因码记忆 + 分级自动化；结果回灌预测与铺货模型决定治理能否收敛。\n本文建立了库存健康异常的识别与处置框架；水位与铺货的定量模型见 <a href=\"multi-echelon-inventory-model\">多级库存部署模型与安全库存水位设定</a> 与 <a href=\"allocation-placement-algorithm\">分仓铺货与首铺/补货分配算法</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"缺货、滞销与库存健康异常治理","id":"缺货-滞销与库存健康异常治理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：库存健康四象限与异常分类","id":"核心概念-库存健康四象限与异常分类"},{"level":2,"text":"库存健康指标体系与异常识别阈值","id":"库存健康指标体系与异常识别阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"缺货治理：归因、止损与补货加速","id":"缺货治理-归因-止损与补货加速"},{"level":2,"text":"滞销与呆滞治理：分层处置阶梯与清仓决策","id":"滞销与呆滞治理-分层处置阶梯与清仓决策"},{"level":2,"text":"平台规则驱动的库龄与低库存成本","id":"平台规则驱动的库龄与低库存成本"},{"level":2,"text":"例外管理闭环：分级预警、根因码与自动化","id":"例外管理闭环-分级预警-根因码与自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分仓铺货与首铺/补货分配算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/overseas-warehouse-network-placement/inventory-deployment-allocation/allocation-placement-algorithm"},"next":{"title":"调拨触发条件与跨仓再平衡决策模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/overseas-warehouse-network-placement/crossborder-transfer-rebalance/transfer-trigger-rebalance-model"}}